# 0.1.19: his own weapon's hit while riding RAC-Board with Weapons on the board (on by default). racboard.sim's ride as
# 0.1.18 had it, the right trigger held through the jump: with the board's weapons on, the trigger is the Bomb Glove's
# (his item at Novalis's start), a bomb into the right palm, and the hand let go of it slowly while he rides on. Before
# the fix its blast took a hit point from him on the board (RAC-Board's trace: "hit ... mask 65536" and the board's
# target-board-hit). Now RAC-Board's trace says "his own weapon's hit: not taken on the board" for any such hit, with no
# target-board-hit and no hit point lost; the ride goes on to the left hand's reach.
